docs {
# Customer payment flow

Run either booking-create request first. The API returns a private `paymentIntentId` and a Telr `checkoutUrl`; no booking is visible to the provider yet.

Open `checkoutUrl` in the system browser, finish the Telr sandbox checkout, then run **Verify payment**. The API verifies directly with Telr and creates the booking only when the Telr order is paid.
}
